  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently in the animator controller the STRAFERT is only mirrored to simulate left movement, It would be great if you could split up left/right movement to allow for custom animations there, or atleast have the option where if you add a STRAFELT manually in the AvatarControllerTemplate like this http://puu.sh/zuL12/c2bdcb5ae0.png the game would pick up on that and use that animation for left strafe instead.\n\nCurrently, even if you delete an entry, for example I deleted WALKFWD without replacing it, my avatar still walked forward without applying a T-pose.\n\nIt might be that this post and the one I link here https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/allow-uploading-your-own-animation-controller-for-humanoids are the same, but for clarity's sake I'll keep this one.",
